 latest reading.\n\nDespite the tight polling, prediction markets still give Kotek roughly a 78-81% chance of winning, and she maintains a fundraising edge while some major Drazan donors from 2022 have not returned. The forecast lands on a narrow Kotek advantage with meaningful uncertainty, closer to a tossup than the ratings imply.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.91, "margin": 7.23}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7143, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6673, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6685, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.7753, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7762, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7967, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7478, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.743, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7131, "margin": 2.5}]}